        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tímea Babos, Jack Sock, Liezel Huber, Bob Bryan, Melanie Oudin\n- Events: 2012 Monterrey Open, 2011 US Open – Mixed Doubles\n- Organizations: Association of Tennis Professionals (ATP)\n- Topics: tennis rankings, singles titles, mixed doubles\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Sock was born on September 24, 1992.\n- Tímea Babos was born on 10 May 1993.\n- In the 2011 US Open – Mixed Doubles, defending champions Liezel Huber and Bob Bryan lost in the second round to teenage compatriots Melanie Oudin and Jack Sock.\n- In 2012, Tímea Babos won the singles title at the 2012 Monterrey Open.\n- Jack Sock is an American professional tennis player.\n- Tímea Babos is a Hungarian tennis player.\n- Jack Sock was ranked world No. 21 in men's singles by the Association of Tennis Professionals (ATP).",
